      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": " 古歌：“地僻君难到，迁地以待君。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "An old poem says: The place is remote, and you can scarcely come, so I moved elsewhere and waited for you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "genji-modern-p02195",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "待君君不来，轲多苦辛。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I waited for you, but you did not come; how full of hardship is this unhappy lot.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
